  $str$&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;★&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;전시 티저 영상 보기&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Cv9rU4KGT98&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(120, 32, 185);&quot;&gt;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Cv9rU4KGT98&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(120, 32, 185);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;국립제주박물관&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;은 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;월 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;16&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;일&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;화&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;부터 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;찰나의 영원, 제주를 담다 -&amp;nbsp; 고 김영갑 작가 기증 사진전&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;(2026. 6. 16.~2027. 3. 1.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;을 개최합니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;이번 전시는 고 김영갑 작가&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;(1957~2005)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;가 생전 촬영했던 김영갑갤러리두모악 소장품이 우리 박물관에 기증됨에 따라 이루어지게 되었습니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;고 김영갑 작가는 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;1985&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;년 제주에 입도한 이래 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;여 년간 작품활동을 이어왔으며&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;손수 개척한 김영갑갤러리두모악에서 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;2005&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;년 생을 마감하였습니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;고달프고 척박한 삶의 환경 속에서 숭고한 작품활동을 한 이유는 무엇이며&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;그가 작품을 통해 우리에게 말하려 한 것은 무엇인지 살펴보고자 합니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;부에서는 작가가 제주에 입도한 이후 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;1990&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;년대 초반까지의 작품을 선보입니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;제주인의 삶과 안식에 대한 작가의 시선을 엿볼 수 있는 흑백사진을 만나볼 수 있습니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;부에서는 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;1990&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;년대 전반기에 집중적으로 촬영한 작품을 전시합니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;오름을 비롯한 제주 자연의 평화로운 모습을 담은 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;6×9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;인치&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;, 6×12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;인치 규격의 컬러사진을 공개합니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;부에서는 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;1990&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;년대 후반기에 촬영한 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;6×17&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;인치 규격의 작품을 전시합니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;가로로 긴 화면에 드러난 오름의 부드러운 곡선미와 찰나의 순간에 포착된 환상적인 자연의 모습을 감상할 수 있습니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;부에서는 루게릭병 발병 이후 조성한 김영갑갤러리두모악에 대하여 이야기합니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;절망적인 상황에서도 희망의 끈을 놓지 않고 두모악 조성을 통해 작품 세계를 이어간 것에 주목하며 김영갑갤러리두모악의 의미를 되새겨보고자 합니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;고 김영갑 작가가 남긴 작품 수는 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;만 점 이상으로 추산되며&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;이번에 기증한 작품은 그 가운데 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;만 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;천여 점입니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;관람객에게 더욱 다양한 작품을 소개하고자 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;부와 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;부 전시 작품을 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;월에 교체 전시합니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;고 김영갑 작가는 작품에 이름을 붙이지 않았습니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;이름이 주어짐으로써 관람객이 갖게 되는 선입견을 배제하고 작품과 소통하기를 바라던 작가의 바람입니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;이번 전시를 통해 고 김영갑 작가가 포착한 제주 자연의 아름다움을 감상하고 마음의 평안함을 얻는 시간 되기를 바랍니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/Upl/se2/202605/0_20260529081116_780.jpg&quot; title=&quot;0_20260529081116_780.jpg&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;clear:both;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/Upl/se2/202605/0_20260529081221_286.jpg&quot; title=&quot;0_20260529081221_286.jpg&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/Upl/se2/202605/0_20260529081348_231.jpg&quot; title=&quot;0_20260529081348_231.jpg&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;clear:both;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;/Upl/se2/202605/B_20260529081306_388.jpg&quot; title=&quot;B_20260529081306_388.jpg&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;hwpEditorBoardContent&quot; class=&quot;hwp_editor_board_content&quot; data-hjsonver=&quot;1.0&quot; data-jsonlen=&quot;12632&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[data-hwpjson]{
