  null,
  $str$<p data-path-to-node="3" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-synthesis: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &#039;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#039;, osaka, sans-serif; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0.15px;">1997년은 재일교포인 두암 김용두 선생의 소장품이 국립진주박물관에 처음 기증된 해입니다.
<p data-path-to-node="3" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-synthesis: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &#039;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#039;, osaka, sans-serif; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0.15px;">기증 30주년을 맞이하는 2027년을 앞두고, 우리 관을 대표하는 기증 컬렉션인
<p data-path-to-node="3" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-synthesis: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &#039;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#039;, osaka, sans-serif; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0.15px;">두암 김용두 선생 수집품 특별전 &lt;나의 인생 박물관&gt;을 개최합니다.
<p data-path-to-node="3" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-synthesis: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &#039;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#039;, osaka, sans-serif; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0.15px;">이번 전시에서는 김용두 선생수집품의 형성과 공개, 그리고 기증에 이르는 과정을 차례대로 돌아보면서
<p data-path-to-node="3" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-synthesis: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &#039;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#039;, osaka, sans-serif; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0.15px;">한 개인이 수집한 문화재가 &#039;기증&#039;이라는 행위를 통해 &#039;모두의 문화유산&#039;으로 거듭나는 과정에 주목하여
<p data-path-to-node="3" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-synthesis: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &#039;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#039;, osaka, sans-serif; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0.15px;">두암기증품이 가지는 의미와 미래 가치를 조망합니다.
<p data-path-to-node="3" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-synthesis: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &#039;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#039;, osaka, sans-serif; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0.15px;">
<p data-path-to-node="4" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-synthesis: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22.5px; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; font-family: &#039;Hiragino Kaku Gothic Pro&#039;, osaka, sans-serif; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0.15px;">$str$,
