<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%; margin-left: 27px; text-indent: -20.4pt;"><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕;"></span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;">* </span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;">「</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕;">국민기초생활 보장법</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;">」</span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕;">에 의한 수급권자 및 차상위계층 해당자</span></p>
