&lt;h6&gt;Introduction&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;exhibition_composition&quot;&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;The Hangeul keyboard layout that has become part of everyday life now dates back to the former Ministry of Science and
Technology&amp;rsquo;s&amp;lsquo;Proposal for a Standard in the Mechanization of Hangeul&amp;rsquo; in 1969. The exhibition, part of our permanent display, will
provide a retrospective on Hangeul typewriters during the height of their use in the 1970s‒1980s&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
